WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:02.860
So is that it...

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.020
I see.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.540
That was pretty bad, huh.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.370
Nevertheless, you're too reserved.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.920
I could've gone to welcome you if you'd asked.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:11.060
Excuse me.
I could've gone to welcome you if you'd asked.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:11.570
Excuse me.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.490
Ahh,.. rejected again.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.140
Ochre's Top likes Chen,

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:24.510
<i>Oi, that can't be true...</i>

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.780
but Chen nominated Third during Kou no Tsuki

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.330
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:28.430
and she was refused.
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.320
and she was refused.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.100
Kou no Tsuki?

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.860
Oo I need to spell it out?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.610
The month for mating.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:38.990
Third!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:47.680
Yes, Top.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.370
What can I do for you?

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:53.920
What's with this sake?!

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.130
It's tasteless!

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:56.610
Bring another!

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:57.630
Yes.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.510
As you've ordered, Top.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.280
Thor?

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:10.730
<i>Ha hah, hah, you know...</i>

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:49.490
<i>I want to leave this planet...</i>

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.970
<i>but I'm learning the ways of living here now.</i>

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.490
So you were here, Thor.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.200
What's up?

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:59.750
What were you thinking about?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.660
Nothing much.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.250
Be more confident, Thor.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.670
After all, you managed to beat Chen!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.260
That was only by chance.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.720
Anyway, everyone treats you differently now.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:16.180
I'm proud of you too, as your second!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.560
"Your Second"?

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.560
What do you mean by that?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.360
Thor and I made a new Ring.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.860
Oh, then congratulations.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.820
We were just mucking around.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.610
We were not!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.610
No one said we can't make a new one.

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:37.740
That's true,

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.330
but at the very least you should have 3 people.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.060
What about your Third?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:46.130
Um... that'll come later...

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.630
Then, let me join.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.710
But you're Ochre's Third, aren't you?

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.340
It's fine,.. fine.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.300
I'm capable, so I'll be ok holding two jobs at once.

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.200
It doesn't matter to me...

00:03:58.910 --> 00:03:59.750
I got it.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:02.050
Well then, here's your first mission:

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.470
Take us to Colin's place.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:05.610
Colin?

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.980
My friend.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.070
He lives in the rocky region near the Sun Ring.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.230
Tiz...

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.530
There's no other way.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.030
There are still heaps of Verasonas in that area.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:18.550
But...

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:20.550
Don't look so troubled.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.580
You know what?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.250
You're a little too stubborn sometimes.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.290
Just use what you can, if it's available to be used.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.220
Good, it's settled.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.510
Let's go right now.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:35.670
Get ready.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.640
Third, I want to talk to you.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.570
I heard you gave birth to a child.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.520
Yuuki's child.

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.570
He'll be a strong child.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.450
That's good.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:57.700
Congratulations.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.420
Third, there is something I must ask you.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.150
Why did you refuse my nomination?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.410
Tell me your reason.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:08.710
Don't hesitate.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:10.790
I need to know!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.050
Just for today...

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.170
just for today, don't tease, and tell me...

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.380
please.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.300
I'm infertile.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.930
I was caused by an illness during my childhood,

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:30.240
so choosing me is useless.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:33.400
But to me, you're...

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.810
That's a pity.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.470
You're a good woman.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.470
This Kou no Tsuki I'm not going to have a child.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.790
Ilza wants a Try with me...

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:45.910
That's why...

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.260
That's a real shame.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.330
What is?

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.990
Good women fighting against each other...

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.720
Do you like Ilza?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:01.930
Not as much as you.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:16.280
Third... it's not Kou no Tsuki yet...

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.950
On the planet where I was born, there's no rule about this.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:24.210
I can touch my woman anytime I want.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.080
Third...

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.740
I don't understand...

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.130
Ah? Did you say something?

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.230
I said I don't understand you.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.680
Becoming my Ring's Third...

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:55.320
I just thought it'd be interesting, so I joined.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.900
How could that possibly be the reason?!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.420
What are you really planning?!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.010
You think too much.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.090
You're being phony again.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.910
I really hate it when you play dumb.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.390
Thor, I see it!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:10.720
It's there.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.620
This way!

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:25.790
Colin!

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.840
I brought some food for you.

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:29.830
Colin!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.990
Colin, it's ok.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.440
Here are all my friends.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.450
There's someone here who wants to talk with you;

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.950
he was just abandoned here from Colony.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.060
Come out, Colin!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.930
Colin, you're fine, right?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.040
So you've come, Tiz.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.090
Have you been keeping well?

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.670
Um... Nice to meet you.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:05.340
I'm Thor Klein.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:07.930
Klein?!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.510
Do you know papa?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.310
You are Klein's... son?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.440
Someone killed papa and mama...

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:21.930
Odin.

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:23.990
Odin?

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.770
Don't tell me! Odin was the one who killed papa?

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:30.940
Come in and I'll talk with you.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.500
I don't know the reason behind it,

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.440
but a political faction opposing Odin was established,

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.760
and there was an assassination plan.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:53.560
On the list of that faction's leaders was Dr Klein's name.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:58.150
That's a lie! Papa was Odin's loyal supporter!

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:03.170
From time to time... he even came to play with us.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:10.120
I was ordered by Odin to stop the assassination plan,

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:15.710
which meant killing everyone who was involved.

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:19.790
This was carried out by the special forces,

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:23.000
And after that, everyone involved in Klein's murder

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:25.010
was abandoned here.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:26.800
What do you mean?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:32.720
I don't think Dr Klein was involved in that assassination plan at all.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.760
Then, are you saying that was papa was killed over a false accusation?!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.650
I'm afraid that the Doctor became an obstruction to Odin,

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:46.110
so he killed him using the assassination plan as an excuse.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:50.370
Then, after that all that was left were his beloved sons.

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.950
So the Kleins are finished, right?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.500
Oi, Third!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.110
Thor!

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:11.550
<i>Odin was... Odin was the one who killed papa.</i>

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.020
<i>I didn't know anything.</i>

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:20.730
<i>I until now I've lived such a sheltered life.</i>

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:27.070
Thor,.. sorry. I...

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:32.330
If I was more grown up, I could've lent papa my strength.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:35.580
Rai too; he didn't need to die.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:38.580
Thor,

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:40.040
become Jyu Oh!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.880
Leave here, and find out what happened.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.680
I'll help you!

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:47.760
You are my Top;

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.930
that's why I'll follow you anywhere, Thor!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:51.820
Tiz...

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.180
Your tears dried up yet?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.810
Go inside.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.810
Even if you drown yourself in tears, it won't change anything.

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:01.280
Wh... who is?!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.980
That's right! Thor didn't cry!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.820
Heh,.. with that spirit you'll be fine.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.190
Let's go back.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.610
I'm getting hungry.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:24.660
Third!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:31.040
Third?! Third! Third?!!

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.840
Third!!!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.540
Third!!!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.780
Everyone get down!

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:44.960
Shit.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.120
Third!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.500
Third, are you ok?

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.370
Hey! Third, wake up!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.530
Third!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:01.920
That's why I said... stop crying so much.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:04.710
Third...

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.120
hurts...

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.590
Sure was strong, that attack.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.070
Third,.. just now, weren't you shot?

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.670
I was. You saw it yourself.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:17.960
But...

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.610
Are you wearing a bulletproof vest?

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:22.520
Bingo.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.070
Don't tell me you know you were going to be shot at?!

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:28.940
Yep. Coming to such a remote place...

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:31.510
there'd surely be someone who would take it as a chance.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.930
Why didn't you say so?!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.090
Would you have been able to protect me if I had?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:37.760
Eh... That's...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:38.610
Third!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.490
As expected, it really was one of Top's assassins.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:42.710
Top?

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.340
It seems his patience is coming to an end.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.330
This isn't the first time.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.120
Well then...

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.270
should we start heading back?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.230
Get back?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.470
To Top's stronghold?

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:57.060
It'll be night soon.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.480
I want to spend the night in comfort.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:01.550
But...

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.390
Well, this always happens.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.840
It's Third, so it'll be fine.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.740
<i>So that's how it is...</i>

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:16.840
<i>Here people don't care that much about death.</i>

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.540
<i>The ones who can't protect themselves will die;</i>

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.080
<i>this is simple 'justice"...</i>

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.040
<i>It's something I still don't understand.</i>

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:28.800
Colin , sorry...

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:33.470
I really wanted you to join the Ochre Ring...

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:38.200
Don't worry, I'm already old.

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:44.170
Even so, I've had Life Extension Surgery; that's why I've lived till now.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:49.180
But... it seems that child hasn't had the surgery yet.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.740
I'm afraid that he'll die before he's 30 years old.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:54.800
Why?..

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.900
People who grow up in Colonies without having the surgery

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.980
will degenerate very quickly after 2O years of age.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.410
It'll be too late then.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.090
No!..

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:11.020
He could be the first one

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:15.820
abandoned on Chimera from the Colony without having had the surgery.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.450
Thor will... die.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.450
Tiz, let's go.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:28.840
Colin-san, thank you for everything you've told me!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.760
Ok then, Colin. We'll come again.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.100
Take care! Colin!

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:47.780
You're sure?

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:51.640
Yes. From now, there won't be any further obstructions to Top.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:53.860
Is that so...

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.990
And... about that...

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:59.390
I understand. The vacant seat of Second...

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:05.410
Third!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.940
You're late, aren't you!

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.410
What happened?

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.410
I'm fine, as you can see.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.750
Yes. But I was worried.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.540
Sorry for that.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:24.890
<i>Odin killed papa.</i>

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.490
<i>In order to leave this planet I have to become Jyu Oh.</i>

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:29.930
<i>Still...</i>

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:36.580
Thor, can I talk to you for a sec?

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:43.750
You came from Colony, right Thor?
Are there many adults like Colin there?

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:48.620
Yeah, but they've all had surgery or have lifeguard systems.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:53.660
I heard that people on the Earth can live for up to 90 years without lifeguard systems.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.680
90 years old... live for 90 years?

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:03.000
Yeah. But even though we're the same human beings as the people on the Earth...

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.770
Rai used to say he'd go to Ion's lab

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:09.020
and research this in the future,

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.110
however...

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.670
Thor, live! You won't die!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.930
You cannot die!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.010
Thor! Became Jyu Oh!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.120
And leave here alive!

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:21.600
You can do it!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.910
Oi, don't fly this fast.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.190
It's dangerous.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.380
I need to confirm it with Colin.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.700
But...

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.340
<i>I can only live for 7 or 8 more years.</i>

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.960
<i>If I don't have surgery...</i>

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.110
<i>I'll die.</i>

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:42.740
Colin!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:47.850
Colin?!

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.220
What is it, Tiz...

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:54.690
Colin...

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:55.880
Why...

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:00.190
This isn't a place where Verasonas attack...

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.710
Who?.. Who was here?

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:06.820
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.280
Third!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.360
What is it?

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.020
You look pale.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.290
Colin is...

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:17.890
Colin is dead.

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:21.320
It seems that... he was attacked by plants.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.550
Really? That's a shame.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:28.650
But he wouldn't have been able to live much longer anyway.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.660
Going through the nights on this planet at his age is harsh.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:37.130
He's probably glad he died before nightfall.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.260
Let's go; Top's waiting.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.600
There's a boring banquet tonight.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:49.520
Chen-san nominated Yuuki last Kou no Tsuki, right?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:50.450
Yeah.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:55.850
Then, next Kou no Tsuki, why don't you nominate me?..

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:01.220
Third's coming. You're late, aren't you!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.990
They really stand out, those three.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.040
Third always has from the start.

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:08.300
With Thor and Tiz he's become more...

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.410
Honestly,.. who's the real Top?!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.600
Third!!!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.460
What do you think you're doing, coming late to my banquet?!

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:28.790
I forgot to mention it. Sorry.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:37.340
Oh, telling other Ring's women your schedule and ignoring your own Top, are you?

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.370
You... what the hell's so funny?!

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.090
Nothing.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:59.230
Pick it up, Third. It's your Top's command.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.810
Bring it here.

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:06.750
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.760
What's the matter?

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.010
Our guests are frightened.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.450
Those eyes... they always look down on people as idiots.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.840
Let's make it clear today,

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.510
who Ochre's Top really is!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.530
Go, pick it up. One more time.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.190
It's fine, Top...

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:37.400
...as many times as you want.

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.680
You damn!!!

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:56.370
You shouldn't be picking up things thrown by this kind of person.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.120
This guy tried to kill Third.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.080
He hasn't got what it takes to be a Top.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.600
Brat... say that again!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.000
I'll say it as many times as you want.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.790
You are not a Top!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.270
If you're a Top, then even I could be one.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:15.910
It's a Try.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.990
You heard it everyone - it's a Try!

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.350
A brat who doesn't know anything...

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.480
Good! I accept it!

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:37.040
Get ready to die!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.830
Thor! It's still too early!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:42.070
Tiz...

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:45.350
This is nonsense! You won't be able to beat him yet!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:50.110
Since you initiated the Try, you definitely can't stop it.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.200
But I...

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.060
I didn't mean a Try!

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.870
Third misunderstood me...

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.240
<i>It wasn't a misunderstanding;</i>

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:07.770
<i>that guy set me up.</i>
